{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_001","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"Running Godot apps on macOS\n===========================","location_hint":"paragraph 2","char_start":27,"char_end":82,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_002","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"This page covers running Godot projects on macOS.\n If you haven't exported your project yet, read :ref:`doc_exporting_for_macos` first.","location_hint":"paragraph 4","char_start":99,"char_end":234,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_003","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"By default, macOS will run only applications that are signed and notarized.","location_hint":"paragraph 5","char_start":236,"char_end":311,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_004","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"When running an app from the Downloads folder or when still in quarantine,\n Gatekeeper will perform *path randomization* as a security measure.\n This breaks access to relative paths from the app, which the app relies upon to work.\n To resolve this issue, move the app to the ``/Applications`` folder.","location_hint":"paragraph 7","char_start":325,"char_end":625,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_005","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"In general, macOS apps should avoid relying on relative paths from the\n application folder.","location_hint":"paragraph 8","char_start":628,"char_end":719,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_006","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"Depending on the way a macOS app is signed and distributed, the following scenarios are possible:","location_hint":"paragraph 9","char_start":721,"char_end":818,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_007","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"App is signed, notarized and distributed via App Store\n------------------------------------------------------","location_hint":"paragraph 10","char_start":820,"char_end":929,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_008","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"App developers need to join the Apple Developer Program, and configure signing and notarization options during export, then upload the app to the App Store.","location_hint":"paragraph 12","char_start":943,"char_end":1099,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_009","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"The app should run out of the box, without extra user interaction required.","location_hint":"paragraph 13","char_start":1101,"char_end":1176,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_010","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"App is signed, notarized and distributed outside App Store\n----------------------------------------------------------","location_hint":"paragraph 14","char_start":1178,"char_end":1295,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_011","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"App developers need to join the Apple Developer Program, and configure signing and notarization options during export, then distribute the app as \".DMG\" or \".ZIP\" archive.","location_hint":"paragraph 16","char_start":1309,"char_end":1480,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_012","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"When you run the app for the first time, the following dialog is displayed:","location_hint":"paragraph 17","char_start":1482,"char_end":1557,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_013","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":".. image:: img/signed_and_notarized_0.png","location_hint":"paragraph 18","char_start":1559,"char_end":1600,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_014","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"Click ``Open`` to start the app.","location_hint":"paragraph 19","char_start":1602,"char_end":1634,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_015","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"If you see the following warning dialog, your Mac is set up to allow apps only from the App Store.","location_hint":"paragraph 20","char_start":1636,"char_end":1734,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_016","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":".. image:: img/signed_and_notarized_1.png","location_hint":"paragraph 21","char_start":1736,"char_end":1777,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_017","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"To allow third-party apps, open ``System Preferences``, click ``Security & Privacy``, then click ``General``, unlock settings, and select ``App Store and identified developers``.","location_hint":"paragraph 22","char_start":1779,"char_end":1957,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_018","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"App is signed (including ad-hoc signatures) but not notarized\n-------------------------------------------------------------","location_hint":"paragraph 24","char_start":1990,"char_end":2113,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_019","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"App developer used self-signed certificate or ad-hoc signing (default Godot behavior for exported project).","location_hint":"paragraph 26","char_start":2127,"char_end":2234,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_020","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"When you run the app for the first time, the following dialog is displayed:","location_hint":"paragraph 27","char_start":2236,"char_end":2311,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_021","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"To run this app, you can temporarily override Gatekeeper:","location_hint":"paragraph 29","char_start":2342,"char_end":2399,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_022","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"* Either open ``System Preferences``, click ``Security & Privacy``, then click ``General``, and click ``Open Anyway``.","location_hint":"paragraph 30","char_start":2401,"char_end":2519,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_023","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"* Or, right-click (Control-click) on the app icon in the Finder window and select ``Open`` from the menu.","location_hint":"paragraph 32","char_start":2553,"char_end":2658,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_024","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"* Then click ``Open`` in the confirmation dialog.","location_hint":"paragraph 34","char_start":2690,"char_end":2739,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_025","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"* Enter your password if you're prompted.","location_hint":"paragraph 36","char_start":2771,"char_end":2812,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_026","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"Another option is to disable Gatekeeper entirely. Note that this does decrease\nthe security of your computer by allowing you to run any software you want.\nTo do this, run ``sudo spctl --master-disable`` in the Terminal, enter your\npassword, and then the **Anywhere** option will be available:","location_hint":"paragraph 37","char_start":2814,"char_end":3106,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_027","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":".. image:: img/macos_allow_from_anywhere.png","location_hint":"paragraph 38","char_start":3109,"char_end":3153,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_028","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"Note that Gatekeeper will re-enable itself when macOS updates.","location_hint":"paragraph 39","char_start":3155,"char_end":3217,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_029","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"App is not signed, executable is linker-signed\n----------------------------------------------","location_hint":"paragraph 40","char_start":3219,"char_end":3312,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_030","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"App is built using official export templates, but it is not signed.","location_hint":"paragraph 42","char_start":3326,"char_end":3393,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_031","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"When you run the app for the first time, the following dialog is displayed:","location_hint":"paragraph 43","char_start":3395,"char_end":3470,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_032","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":".. image:: img/linker_signed_1.png","location_hint":"paragraph 44","char_start":3472,"char_end":3506,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_033","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"To run this app, you should remove the quarantine extended file attribute manually:","location_hint":"paragraph 45","char_start":3508,"char_end":3591,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_034","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"* Open ``Terminal.app`` (press :kbd:`Cmd + Space` and enter ``Terminal``).","location_hint":"paragraph 46","char_start":3593,"char_end":3667,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_035","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"* Navigate to the folder containing the target application.","location_hint":"paragraph 47","char_start":3669,"char_end":3728,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_036","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"Use the ``cd path_to_the_app_folder`` command, e.g. ``cd ~/Downloads/`` if it's in the ``Downloads`` folder.","location_hint":"paragraph 48","char_start":3731,"char_end":3839,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_037","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"* Run the command ``xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine \"Unsigned Game.app\"`` (including quotation marks and ``.app`` extension).","location_hint":"paragraph 49","char_start":3841,"char_end":3965,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_038","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"Neither app nor executable is signed (relevant for Apple Silicon Macs only)\n---------------------------------------------------------------------------","location_hint":"paragraph 50","char_start":3967,"char_end":4118,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_039","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"App is built using custom export templates, compiled using OSXCross, and it is not signed at all.","location_hint":"paragraph 52","char_start":4132,"char_end":4229,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_040","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"When you run the app for the first time, the following dialog is displayed:","location_hint":"paragraph 53","char_start":4231,"char_end":4306,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_041","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"To run this app, you can ad-hoc sign it yourself:","location_hint":"paragraph 55","char_start":4339,"char_end":4388,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_042","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"* Install ``Xcode`` for the App Store, start it and confirm command line tools installation.","location_hint":"paragraph 56","char_start":4390,"char_end":4482,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_043","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"* Open ``Terminal.app`` (press :kbd:`Cmd + Space` and enter ``Terminal``).","location_hint":"paragraph 57","char_start":4484,"char_end":4558,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_044","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"* Navigate to the folder containing the target application.","location_hint":"paragraph 58","char_start":4560,"char_end":4619,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_045","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"Use the ``cd path_to_the_app_folder`` command, e.g. ``cd ~/Downloads/`` if it's in the ``Downloads`` folder.","location_hint":"paragraph 59","char_start":4622,"char_end":4730,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_046","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"``xattr -dr com.apple.quarantine \"Unsigned Game.app\"`` (including quotation marks and \".app\" extension).","location_hint":"paragraph 61","char_start":4764,"char_end":4868,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_5b703b620109_047","source_id":"src_5b703b620109","source_hash":"f593e3bd395a9767f3ce92b0f8c3ba9be3252a085c3ee229a2c35336ff3fb7fb","text":"``codesign -s - --force --deep \"Unsigned Game.app\"`` (including quotation marks and \".app\" extension).","location_hint":"paragraph 62","char_start":4871,"char_end":4973,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-10T05:04:06.486Z"}
